From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lars Trieloff <lars@trieloff.net>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:38:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] cli: compile out modules that cannot run on WASI

On WASI the mcp, proxy, tui, daemon and plugin commands (fnox-core's
plugins module, which installs Lua plugins with git, since 1.40.0), the lease backend
implementations, the shared HTTP client, the keyring store, credential
commands and the interactive prompts (init wizard, auth retry, lease
and secret value prompts) are not built. Leases fail with "leases are
not available in the WASI build of fnox", `fnox set` without a value
asks for an argument or stdin, `fnox init` writes a minimal
configuration, and the daemon is never started in the background.

